sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    %% Flow 1: Pipeline Run Execution
    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
    Note over User,S3: Flow 1: Pipeline Run Execution

    participant User as User / Dashboard
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant API as API Server<br/>8888/TCP REST<br/>8887/TCP gRPC
    participant DB as MariaDB<br/>3306/TCP MySQL
    participant Argo as Argo Workflow<br/>Controller
    participant Pods as Pipeline Step Pods
    participant S3 as S3 Object Storage<br/>9000 or 443/TCP
    participant MLMD as MLMD gRPC<br/>8080/TCP
    participant PA as Persistence Agent

    User->>KRBP: POST pipeline run<br/>HTTPS TLS (service-CA)<br/>Auth: SubjectAccessReview
    KRBP->>API: Forward (authenticated)
    API->>DB: Store run metadata<br/>MySQL, Conditional TLS<br/>Auth: Password
    API->>Argo: Create Workflow CR<br/>Kubernetes API, TLS<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount

    Argo->>Pods: Launch pipeline step pods<br/>Pod lifecycle<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    Pods->>S3: Upload/download artifacts<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Conditional TLS<br/>Auth: AccessKey/SecretKey
    Pods->>MLMD: Record lineage metadata<br/>gRPC, Conditional TLS<br/>Auth: None (NetworkPolicy)

    PA->>API: Sync run status<br/>HTTP/gRPC :8888/:8887<br/>Conditional TLS, SA token
    PA->>MLMD: Read execution metadata<br/>gRPC :8080<br/>Conditional TLS
    end

    %% Flow 2: External Metadata Access
    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
    Note over User,DB: Flow 2: External Metadata Access

    participant Envoy as MLMD Envoy<br/>gRPC-web proxy
    participant KRBP2 as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    User->>KRBP2: Query metadata<br/>HTTPS via Route (Reencrypt)<br/>Auth: SubjectAccessReview
    KRBP2->>Envoy: Forward (authenticated)
    Envoy->>MLMD: gRPC request<br/>:8080 Conditional TLS<br/>Auth: None (internal)
    MLMD->>DB: Query metadata<br/>MySQL :3306<br/>Conditional TLS, Password
    DB-->>MLMD: Result set
    MLMD-->>Envoy: gRPC response
    Envoy-->>KRBP2: gRPC-web response
    KRBP2-->>User: HTTPS response
    end

    %% Flow 3: Managed Pipeline Import
    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
    Note over Operator,API: Flow 3: Managed Pipeline Import

    participant Operator as DSPO Controller
    participant OCI as OCI Container Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Operator->>OCI: Fetch managed-pipelines.json<br/>HTTPS TLS<br/>Auth: Registry credentials
    OCI-->>Operator: OCI manifest + layers
    Operator->>Operator: Validate pipeline names<br/>against AllowedRegistries
    Note over Operator: Deploy init container<br/>with pipeline image<br/>→ emptyDir volume
    Operator->>API: API Server reads pipelines<br/>from emptyDir volume<br/>Uploads via REST :8888
    end
